  "comments": "A few types are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">I</span> - large coat of arms with wide Slovak shield.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">II</span> - small coat of arms with narrow Slovak shield, fur lines with one additional narrow line in lion mane on each side of small shield.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6381313e325c6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6381313e325c6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"223\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - end of tail in numeral &quot;2&quot; long.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - end of tail in numeral &quot;2&quot; short, long serif at the bottom left to &quot;h&quot;.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/638131802595b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/638131802595b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">I</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1972-1980.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">I</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1980-1985.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">II</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1986-1990.",
